{
  "schema": "wh.morph-sliders/1",
  "span": 0.5,
  "meta_max": 1.25,
  "_comment": "Creation-suite BODY MORPHING + FACE DEFORMATION slider catalog. ONE source of truth for (a) tools/mb-lab/bake_morph_templates.py, which bakes every slider into the 9 template GLBs as glTF morph targets '<id>+' (slider -> +1) and '<id>-' (slider -> -1), and (b) the suite (customization/creation-suite-ui/js/morph-targets.js), which drives mesh.morphTargetInfluences from the slider value. Slider value is relative to the template: 0 = the template's own shape. Labels are generic player-facing names (names law: no source-game or real-person names). 'mb' = MB-Lab character_data property (or meta:mass / meta:tone for the global transformations). Window / group structure follows the source games: WWE 2K22 Create-A-Superstar APPEARANCE -> Body (Body Type, Body Morphing per region) and Face (Face Deformation per region, Facial Parts eyes/eyebrows/nose/cheek/mouth/jaw/ears/eyelids/lips); region list from the WrestleMania XIX CAW FIGURE editor (crown/head/neck/shoulder/upperarm/forearm/hand/chest/waist/abdomen/thigh/calf/foot) — see sources.",
  "sources": {
    "WWE_FACEBODY": "customization/creation-suite-ui/js/menu-data.js MENU_SRC.WWE_FACEBODY + docs/research/WWE2K22-CREATION-SUITE-2026-10-23.md §2.2 Face (Face Template, Facial Parts eyes/eyebrows/nose/cheek/mouth/jaw/ears/eyelids/lips position+size, Face Deformation morph sliders per facial region) and §2.3 Body (Body Type, body morphing)",
    "WMXIX_CAW": "customization/creation-suite-ui/js/menu-data.js MENU_SRC.WMXIX_CAW — FIGURE: per-region width/length/depth sliders crown/head/neck/shoulder/upperarm/forearm/hand/chest/waist/abdomen/thigh/calf/foot",
    "WWE_CAW_TECH": "customization/wwe2k-caw/CAW-SUITE-BREAKDOWN.md §3 — base template + parametric morph targets; height/weight scale the skeleton (kept as the PROPORTIONS bone sliders)",
    "T7_LAYOUT": "teardown/tekken7-steam-ui/T7-UI-LAYOUT.md + packages/creation-suite/src/t7layout.js — category list left, live fighter preview, item/sub-window panel (window chrome)",
    "MB_LAB": "MB-Lab 1.8.1 morph database (data/morphs/human_*_morphs.json, *_ca01_morphs.json; AGPL-3.0 database) baked headless by tools/mb-lab/bake_morph_templates.py"
  },
